  "title": "Top Northern Colorado Realtor - The Little Lady Sells Homes",
  "description": "Looking for a reliable and experienced realtor in Northern Colorado? Look no further than The Little Lady Sells Homes! With expertise in the local market, down payment assistance programs, and a dedication to helping first-time homebuyers, Christine Gwinnup is the perfect partner for your home buying journey. Contact us at 303-709-4262 today to learn more and start your search for your dream home!",
