      "id": "6a84f8560688ce02e50f0fd7",
      "type": "customContent",
      "options": {
       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><body><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:26px;\">First Time Home Buyer Grants are Available in Colorado</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"15\" cellspacing=\"5\" style=\"width:100%;\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; width: 50%;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Hoping to become a homeowner but don't know where to start? Contact Christine at The Little Lady Sells Homes. She's dedicated to helping first-time homebuyers achieve their dream of homeownership. With her expertise and guidance, many clients have been able to purchase homes with <a href=\"https://www.chfainfo.com/homeownership/down-payment-assistance\">down payment assistance programs</a> and $500 toward closing costs. Fill out the form&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-form-id=\"300211461\" href=\"/client-appreciation-offer\" target=\"modal_form\">HERE</a></span> for consideration or call 303-709-4262 to learn more. Christine also hosts First-Time Homebuyer Seminars covering topics such as pre-approval, credit scores, finding the right home, negotiating, and closing deals. Achieve your dream of homeownership with Christine's help.</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-form-id=\"300212984\" href=\"/first-time-homebuyer-guide\" target=\"modal_form\">Get Your&nbsp;Free First Time Homebuyer Guide</a></p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SuP9-KdJpsU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Fill out the information below to schedule a consultation with The Little Lady</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p></body></html>\n"
